build/bin
node_modules
frontend/build
export.md
.kiro/

# Wails v3 build output. `bin/` is where the Taskfile puts the executable
# (v2 used build/bin), `.task` is go-task's up-to-date checksum cache, and the
# .syso is the generated Windows resource file - icon, manifest and version
# info - rebuilt from build/windows on every build.
bin
.task
*.syso

# Written by `go test -coverprofile`, which CI runs on every push and uploads
# as an artifact. Running the same command locally should not leave a file to
# explain.
coverage.out

# The graphify knowledge graph - graph.json, the interactive graph.html, the
# report and an extraction cache. All of it is derived from the tree it sits
# in, and `graphify . --update` rebuilds whatever has changed, so committing it
# would mean carrying a megabyte that goes stale on every merge.
graphify-out/
